---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import pubs from '../content/publications.json';
---
<Layout title="Publications"><section class="page-intro"><p class="eyebrow">RESEARCH OUTPUT</p><h1>Publications</h1><p>원본 자료에 수록된 2022–2026년 주요 연구 성과</p></section><section class="content"><div class="filters"><input id="search" type="search" placeholder="논문 제목, 저자, 학술지 검색" aria-label="논문 검색"/><select id="year" aria-label="발행 연도"><option value="all">모든 연도</option>{[...new Set(pubs.map(p=>p.year))].map(y=><option value={y}>{y}</option>)}</select></div><p class="result-count" aria-live="polite"><span id="count">{pubs.length}</span> publications</p>{pubs.map(p=><article class="pub-row pub-item" data-year={p.year} data-search={`${p.title} ${p.authors} ${p.journal}`.toLowerCase()}><span class="pub-year">{p.year}</span><div><h3>{p.title}</h3><p>{p.authors}<br/><em>{p.journal}</em> · {p.year}</p>{p.doi && <a class="pub-links" href={p.doi}>DOI · 논문 원문 ↗</a>}</div></article>)}<p id="empty" class="empty" hidden>검색 결과가 없습니다. 다른 검색어나 연도를 선택해 주세요.</p></section><script>const search=document.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>('#search')!;const year=document.querySelector<HTMLSelectElement>('#year')!;const rows=[...document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('.pub-item')];function filter(){let count=0;for(const row of rows){const match=(year.value==='all'||row.dataset.year===year.value)&&(row.dataset.search||'').includes(search.value.toLowerCase().trim());row.hidden=!match;if(match)count++}document.querySelector('#count')!.textContent=String(count);document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('#empty')!.hidden=count>0}search.addEventListener('input',filter);year.addEventListener('change',filter);</script></Layout>
